  "color_rule": "Owner decision, 23 November 2026 (ADR-0040, amended): marks show in their brand colours in the Store, Settings > Connectors and the session's Connectors section. `color.light` is drawn on the light presets' tile (Bone), `color.dark` on the dark presets' (Card catalog, Graphite, Typewriter). Each is the brand's own colour (Simple Icons' `hex`) where it reaches 3:1 against that tile (WCAG 1.4.11, the system's floor for marks), else the brand's one-colour black or white version. components/item-mark.test.ts checks every pair against every preset."
